    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n16 Wyckham Point is a bright and well-presented two-bedroom third-floor apartment ideally positioned within this highly regarded development in the heart of Dundrum. Enjoying a spacious layout and a large private balcony, the property offers well-balanced accommodation in one of South Dublin's most convenient and sought-after residential locations.\n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hallway with laminate flooring and a useful storage/cloakroom. The spacious living/dining room is flooded with natural light through floor-to-ceiling windows and doors, which open directly onto the generously proportioned balcony, recently upgraded with composite decking. The adjoining kitchen is fitted with a range of appliances including a Bosch dishwasher, Samsung washing machine, Panasonic fridge freezer, induction hob with extractor hood and Hotpoint oven.\n\nThere are two well-proportioned double bedrooms, with the principal bedroom benefiting from fitted wardrobes. A fully tiled family bathroom completes the accommodation.\nWyckham Point is a highly regarded development built by O'Malley Construction and Dorville Homes, set amidst beautifully maintained landscaped grounds. Residents benefit from a 24-hour concierge service, CCTV monitoring, secure underground parking and excellent on-site amenities including a private gym, sauna and steam room. A particular feature of the development is the beautifully maintained private residents' park and retreat area, providing a peaceful setting exclusively for residents to enjoy.\n\nConveniently located off the Wyckham Bypass, the development is within walking distance of Dundrum Town Centre, Balally Luas Stop and a host of local shops, cafés and restaurants. The area is also well served by a number of highly regarded primary and secondary schools, colleges and educational facilities. Marlay Park, Airfield Estate and the M50 are all easily accessible, making this an exceptionally well-connected location.\n\nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a spacious apartment within one of South Dublin's most popular developments, offering an ideal combination of comfort, convenience and superb resident amenities."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 3.33m x 1.25m\nSpacious entrance hallway with laminate flooring, radiator, light fixture and storage/cloakroom.\n\nKitchen/ Living Dining Room - 6.38m x 3.87m\nBright and spacious open-plan kitchen/living/dining room with laminate flooring throughout the living and dining areas, floor-to-ceiling windows and door leading to a large balcony, radiator, tiled kitchen floor and tiled splashback. The kitchen is fitted with a range of appliances including a Bosch dishwasher, Samsung washing machine, Panasonic fridge freezer, induction hob with extractor hood, sink with NobeBird tap featuring power function and Hotpoint oven.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.16m x 2.61m\nExceptionally spacious balcony, recently refloored with composite decking.\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.95m x 2.48m\nLaminate flooring, radiator, light fixture.\n\nBathroom - 2.12m x 2.15m\nFully tiled, comprising bath, wash hand basin and mirrored vanity unit.\n\nBalcony - 7.09m x 1.89m\nExceptionally spacious balcony, recently refloored with composite decking.\n\n"
      },
